---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="zh-TW">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-32.png" />
		<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>FlowerConditionMap - 花況地圖 | 即時賞花資訊分享平台</title>
		<meta name="description" content="FlowerConditionMap 讓您即時記錄和分享各地的花況資訊，在互動式地圖上查看其他人分享的賞花照片。AI 輔助辨識、時間軸回放，掌握最佳賞花時機。" />
	</head>
	<body class="bg-gradient-pink-green">

		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<header class="min-vh-100 d-flex align-items-center py-5">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row justify-content-center text-center">
					<div class="col-lg-10">
						<!-- App Icon -->
						<div class="mb-4">
							<img src="/app-icon.png" alt="花況地圖 App 圖示" width="96" height="96" class="rounded-4xl shadow-lg" />
						</div>

						<!-- Title -->
						<h1 class="display-1 fw-bold mb-4 text-dark">
							花況地圖
						</h1>

						<!-- Subtitle -->
						<p class="fs-3 text-dark mb-3">
							即時記錄與分享賞花資訊
						</p>

						<p class="fs-5 text-secondary mb-5 px-lg-5">
							透過 AI 輔助辨識、智能審核機制和時間軸回放，幫助賞花愛好者掌握最佳賞花時機和地點
						</p>

						<!-- App Store Badge -->
						<div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
							<a href="#" class="text-decoration-none">
								<img src="/app-store-badge.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" height="50" class="hover-opacity">
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- Features Section -->
		<section class="py-5 backdrop-blur">
			<div class="container py-5">
				<div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
					<div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
						<h2 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">主要功能</h2>
						<p class="fs-5 text-secondary">完整的賞花體驗，從記錄到分享</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="row g-4">
					<!-- Feature 1 -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm bg-gradient-feature-1 rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<div class="fs-1 mb-3">🗺️</div>
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">花況地圖</h3>
								<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
									自動讀取照片內的 GPS 資訊標記拍攝地點，在互動式地圖上瀏覽各地花況，快速掌握附近哪裡正在開花
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Feature 4 -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm bg-gradient-feature-4 rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<div class="fs-1 mb-3">🌷</div>
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">花況分級顯示</h3>
								<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
	每種花卉依生長特性設計專屬花況分級（如含苞、盛開、花吹雪、轉紅、落葉等），一眼看出各地花況進度，掌握最佳賞花時機
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Feature 2 -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm bg-gradient-feature-2 rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<div class="fs-1 mb-3">⏱️</div>
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">即時時間軸瀏覽</h3>
								<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
									獨家功能！以動畫方式播放近期花況照片變化，時間範圍依花種花期自動調整，逐日呈現花況擴散趨勢，一眼看懂目前的開花進度
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Feature 5 -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm bg-gradient-feature-5 rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<div class="fs-1 mb-3">🔍</div>
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">歷史資料回退</h3>
								<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
									當最近無資料時，自動查詢去年同期的滿開照片，全年都能參考花況
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Feature 7 -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm bg-gradient-feature-7 rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<div class="fs-1 mb-3">❤️</div>
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">收藏喜愛地點</h3>
								<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
									一鍵收藏賞花地點，依花種篩選管理收藏清單，隨時掌握回訪時機
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Feature 6 -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm bg-gradient-feature-6 rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<div class="fs-1 mb-3">🛡️</div>
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">社群監督機制</h3>
								<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
									照片檢舉功能和智能審核系統，確保平台資訊準確可靠
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Flower Types Section -->
		<section class="py-5">
			<div class="container py-5">
				<div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
					<div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
						<h2 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">支援 6 種花卉</h2>
						<p class="fs-5 text-secondary">依季節分類，涵蓋春夏秋冬四季美景</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="row g-4">
					<!-- Spring -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 season-spring rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-4 text-pink-700">🌸 春季</h3>
								<ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
									<li class="mb-2"><span class="me-2">🌸</span> 櫻花</li>
									<li class="mb-0"><span class="me-2">🪻</span> 紫藤</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Summer -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 season-summer rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-4 text-blue-700">☀️ 夏季</h3>
								<ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
									<li class="mb-0"><span class="me-2">🌺</span> 鳳凰木</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Autumn -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 season-autumn rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-4 text-orange-700">🍂 秋季</h3>
								<ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
									<li class="mb-0"><span class="me-2">🍁</span> 楓葉</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Winter -->
					<div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
						<div class="card h-100 border-0 season-winter rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4">
								<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-4 text-warning">❄️ 冬季</h3>
								<ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
									<li class="mb-2"><span class="me-2">🍂</span> 銀杏</li>
									<li class="mb-0"><span class="me-2">🌲</span> 落羽松</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Flowering Stage Timeline Section -->
		<section class="py-5 backdrop-blur">
			<div class="container py-5">
				<div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
					<div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
						<h2 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">花期全階段，都用得上</h2>
						<p class="fs-5 text-secondary">從行前規劃到花期尾聲，依當下花況給你不同的賞花建議</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="row justify-content-center">
					<div class="col-lg-8">
						<!-- Stage 1: Before the season -->
						<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4xl mb-4">
							<div class="card-body p-4 d-flex align-items-start gap-4">
								<div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center stage-icon-1 rounded-circle shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="width: 56px; height: 56px; font-size: 1.5rem;">
									🗓️
								</div>
								<div>
									<h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">花期前・提前規劃</h3>
									<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
										出發前查看歷史花況紀錄，掌握過往哪些地點看得到花，提前排好旅遊行程
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Stage 2: Early season -->
						<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4xl mb-4">
							<div class="card-body p-4 d-flex align-items-start gap-4">
								<div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center stage-icon-2 rounded-circle shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="width: 56px; height: 56px; font-size: 1.5rem;">
									🌱
								</div>
								<div>
									<h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">花期初期・掌握開花進度</h3>
									<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
										抵達當地正值花期剛開始，即時查看哪裡已經開花、哪裡還含苞待放，抓緊時機前往
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Stage 3: Peak season -->
						<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4xl mb-4">
							<div class="card-body p-4 d-flex align-items-start gap-4">
								<div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center stage-icon-3 rounded-circle shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="width: 56px; height: 56px; font-size: 1.5rem;">
									🌸
								</div>
								<div>
									<h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">花期盛開・發掘私房景點</h3>
									<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
										花期正盛時，除了熱門大景點，還能發現其他人分享的私房賞花地點，避開人潮盡情賞花
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Stage 4: Late season -->
						<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4xl">
							<div class="card-body p-4 d-flex align-items-start gap-4">
								<div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center stage-icon-4 rounded-circle shadow-lg flex-shrink-0" style="width: 56px; height: 56px; font-size: 1.5rem;">
									🍃
								</div>
								<div>
									<h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">花期末段・把握最後美景</h3>
									<p class="text-secondary mb-0">
										就算晚到也不錯過：查看哪裡花還未謝，或欣賞櫻吹雪、銀杏黃金地毯等花期尾聲限定的景色
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Use Cases Section -->
		<section class="py-5" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff, #f0fdf4);">
			<div class="container py-5">
				<div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
					<div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
						<h2 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">適用場景</h2>
						<p class="fs-5 text-secondary">不只是賞花，更是生活美學的記錄</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="row g-4">
					<div class="col-md-4">
						<div class="text-center">
							<div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center use-case-icon-1 rounded-circle shadow-lg mb-4" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; font-size: 2.5rem;">
								🌺
							</div>
							<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">賞花愛好者</h3>
							<p class="text-secondary">
								查詢附近花況，規劃賞花行程，分享美好體驗
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="col-md-4">
						<div class="text-center">
							<div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center use-case-icon-2 rounded-circle shadow-lg mb-4" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; font-size: 2.5rem;">
								🗺️
							</div>
							<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">旅遊規劃</h3>
							<p class="text-secondary">
								掌握不同地區花期，發現熱門景點，預測最佳時機
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="col-md-4">
						<div class="text-center">
							<div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center use-case-icon-3 rounded-circle shadow-lg mb-4" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; font-size: 2.5rem;">
								📷
							</div>
							<h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">攝影愛好者</h3>
							<p class="text-secondary">
								尋找絕佳拍攝地點，掌握最佳拍攝時機，分享精彩作品
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- CTA Section -->
		<section class="py-5">
			<div class="container py-5">
				<div class="row justify-content-center text-center">
					<div class="col-lg-8">
						<h2 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4">開始您的賞花之旅</h2>
						<p class="fs-5 text-secondary mb-5">
							立即下載，探索身邊的花卉美景
						</p>

						<a href="#" class="text-decoration-none">
							<img src="/app-store-badge.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" height="60" class="hover-opacity">
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="py-5 bg-dark text-white">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="text-center">
					<img src="/app-icon.png" alt="花況地圖 App 圖示" width="56" height="56" class="rounded-4xl shadow-sm mb-3" />
					<p class="text-white-50 mb-2">FlowerConditionMap - 花況地圖</p>
					<p class="text-white-50 small mb-0">© 2026 FlowerConditionMap. All rights reserved.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</footer>

		<!-- Bootstrap Bundle with Popper -->
		<script>
			import 'bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js';
		</script>

	</body>
</html>
